{"seq":17,"slug":"ai-friendly-data-layer","title":"AI 友好的数据层","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-native-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-data-layer","rating":{"composite":3.95,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ai-友好的数据层-简介\">AI 友好的数据层 简介</h1><p>几乎每个真实项目都有一层数据:数据库的表、字段、关系,读写数据的代码,演进数据结构的迁移。agent 工作时绕不开这层——它要读懂数据怎么组织才写得对查询、要安全地改数据结构而不毁掉已有数据、要在一致的数据环境里验证自己的改动。数据层和无状态的代码有本质不同:它<strong>有状态、难回滚、易酿大祸</strong>——代码改错了回滚重来,数据改错了可能永远找不回。所以数据层的 AI 友好是两件事叠在一起:既要让 agent <strong>读得懂</strong>(schema 显式、访问带类型),更要让它<strong>改得安全</strong>(护栏、可复现、可验证)。本 hub 讲的就是怎么把数据层做成 agent 读得懂、改得稳、验得了的样子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-讲什么-不讲什么\">本 hub 讲什么 / 不讲什么</h2><p>本 hub 聚焦「项目自己的数据层」这一高风险层面的 AI 友好,不重复展开它依赖的通用能力。下面这张表划清它和兄弟 hub 的边界:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你关心的问题</th>\n<th>去这里</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据层怎么让 agent 读得懂、改得安全(schema、迁移、访问、可复现)</td>\n<td><strong>本 hub</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整个代码库的可读性、模块边界、可验证性等通用架构原则</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ai-friendly-architecture/\">AI 友好的架构</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>把项目知识(含 schema 位置)喂给 agent 的上下文工程</td>\n<td><a href=\"../context-engineering-for-codebases/\">面向代码库的上下文工程</a> / <a href=\"../project-context-files/\">项目上下文文件</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对外/对 agent 暴露的 API 与工具(MCP、工具 schema)怎么设计</td>\n<td><a href=\"../agent-ready-apis-and-tools/\">面向 agent 的 API 与工具</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试作为验证回路、确定性测试、CI 闸门的通用做法</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ai-friendly-testing/\">AI 友好的测试</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>agent 的权限、沙箱、审批闸、注入防御等安全边界</td>\n<td><a href=\"../agent-security-boundaries/\">agent 安全边界</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据访问出错后,错误/日志怎么让 agent 自纠</td>\n<td><a href=\"../observability-and-errors-for-agents/\">面向 agent 的可观测与错误</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之:测试、安全、上下文、可观测各 hub 讲「通用能力」,本 hub 讲这些能力<strong>落到数据这个最危险的层面</strong>时该怎么做——为什么这里的护栏、验证、可逆性比别处更不可省。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>全篇按「先懂、再改、再验、最后固化进上下文」的顺序展开四章:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>数据层与 agent</strong>——数据层为什么要紧、schema 作为上下文、agent 能理解的数据访问。</li>\n<li><strong>schema 与迁移</strong>——显式带类型的 schema、和 agent 一起做安全迁移、种子与测试数据。</li>\n<li><strong>数据访问的模式</strong>——带类型的查询与 ORM、数据访问上的护栏、避开数据层的暗坑。</li>\n<li><strong>数据融入 AI 工作流</strong>——可复现的数据环境、验证数据改动、把数据层写进上下文。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>按人群可以这样走:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>想先建立心智模型的人</strong>:读第 1 章三节即可,理解「数据层有状态、难回滚、易酿大祸」这条主线,以及 schema 为什么是 agent 的「数据地图」。</li>\n<li><strong>正在动手让现有项目对 agent 友好的工程师</strong>:重点读第 2、3 章——把 schema 显式化、访问类型化、给数据访问加护栏、避开 N+1/误删全表等暗坑,这是收益最直接的部分。</li>\n<li><strong>要把数据层接进 agent 日常工作流的人</strong>:读第 4 章——一键起、一键重置的可复现数据环境,「先验证再上」的硬规矩,以及把数据层知识写进 AGENTS.md/文档,让 agent 一上来就知道怎么在本项目里安全碰数据。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>数据库与数据建模基础:表/集合、字段、类型、关系、约束(非空、唯一、外键)、迁移、事务、索引等概念。</li>\n<li>对 agent 编码工作流有基本认识——agent 怎么读项目、改代码、跑验证;建议先过一遍 <a href=\"../ai-friendly-architecture/\">AI 友好的架构</a> 建立通用心智,再来看数据层这个高风险特例。</li>\n<li>不需要精通某个具体 ORM 或数据库:本 hub 讲的是跨技术栈的原则与模式,具体工具(Prisma、Drizzle、SQLAlchemy 等)只作举例。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-layer-and-agents","title":"Data Layer And Agents","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-data-layer/data-layer-and-agents","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-the-data-layer-matters","title":"数据层为什么要紧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-data-layer/data-layer-and-agents/why-the-data-layer-matters"},{"seq":2,"slug":"schema-as-context","title":"Schema 作为上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-data-layer/data-layer-and-agents/schema-as-context"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-access-agents-understand","title":"Agent 能理解的数据访问","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-data-layer/data-layer-and-agents/data-access-agents-understand"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"schemas-and-migrations","title":"Schemas And Migrations","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-data-layer/schemas-and-migrations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"explicit-typed-schemas","title":"显式、带类型的 Schema","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-data-layer/schemas-and-migrations/explicit-typed-schemas"},{"seq":2,"slug":"safe-migrations-with-agents","title":"和 Agent 一起做安全迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-data-layer/schemas-and-migrations/safe-migrations-with-agents"},{"seq":3,"slug":"seed-and-test-data","title":"种子与测试数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-data-layer/schemas-and-migrations/seed-and-test-data"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-access-patterns","title":"Data Access Patterns","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-data-layer/data-access-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"typed-queries-and-orms","title":"带类型的查询与 ORM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-data-layer/data-access-patterns/typed-queries-and-orms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"guardrails-on-data-access","title":"数据访问上的护栏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-data-layer/data-access-patterns/guardrails-on-data-access"},{"seq":3,"slug":"avoiding-data-footguns","title":"避开数据层的暗坑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-data-layer/data-access-patterns/avoiding-data-footguns"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"data-in-the-ai-workflow","title":"Data In The Ai Workflow","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-data-layer/data-in-the-ai-workflow","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reproducible-data-environments","title":"可复现的数据环境","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-data-layer/data-in-the-ai-workflow/reproducible-data-environments"},{"seq":2,"slug":"validating-data-changes","title":"验证数据改动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-data-layer/data-in-the-ai-workflow/validating-data-changes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"documenting-the-data-layer","title":"把数据层写进上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-data-layer/data-in-the-ai-workflow/documenting-the-data-layer"}]}]}